Yes. And there is an important update to the certification path: **as of October 2026, the old AI-900 and AI-102 certifications are retired**. Microsoft replaced that path with **AI-901** at fundamentals level and **AI-103** at the AI engineer/developer level. ([Microsoft Learn][1])

For **your 12 years of DevOps/Azure experience**, I would not follow a generic AI-engineer roadmap. I'd use the certification path as a framework, while making the labs heavily DevOps-oriented.

