# Phase 4 — Function calling / tool calling

### Duration: 2–3 weeks

This should be a major focus.

Suppose your AI says:

```text
I need to inspect the pod logs.
```

Your application provides a function:

```text
get_pod_logs(namespace, pod)
```

The AI requests the function.

Your Python program executes:

```bash
kubectl logs ...
```

Then gives the output back to the model.

The model analyzes it.

That's fundamentally different from simply putting logs into ChatGPT.

